# Memcheck suppressions for `make leak-check` (tests/leak_check.sh).
#
# Only third-party noise belongs here: allocations owned by glibc, the
# dynamic loader or system libraries that efs code cannot free. Never
# suppress a stack whose allocating frame is efs code; fix the leak instead.
# Each entry names the library, why it is not ours, and the host it was
# seen on.
#
# (No entries yet: the K26 run on efs2, Fedora 42 aarch64, glibc 2.41,
# valgrind 3.26.0, reported no third-party definite leaks.)
